🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps being killed by its liveness probe because its containers get too little time to start. Liveness gives api 40s (10s delay + 3 × 10s) but api normally needs about 75s to become ready (last 5 starts), so it is killed before it finishes starting. A startupProbe or a longer delay would let it start. Every error mentions it. To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs api-8ab26137-f -c app -n shop --previous
